### ---- Phases (the depth made explicit; ordinal-ordered within each workflow)

silm:phase_s0_1 a owl:NamedIndividual, silm:Phase ; rdfs:label "Create external/skills/superpowers submodule" ; silm:hasOrdinal 1 .
silm:phase_s0_2 a owl:NamedIndividual, silm:Phase ; rdfs:label "Full-read all 14 skills (no truncation)" ; silm:hasOrdinal 2 .
silm:phase_s0_3 a owl:NamedIndividual, silm:Phase ; rdfs:label "Adopt skills as the governing discipline" ; silm:hasOrdinal 3 .

silm:phase_g_1 a owl:NamedIndividual, silm:Phase ; rdfs:label "Author DAG TBox (Workflow/Phase/Task/Gate)" ; silm:hasOrdinal 1 .
silm:phase_g_2 a owl:NamedIndividual, silm:Phase ; rdfs:label "Author DAG ABox (S0,G,W1-W5,X + phases + edges)" ; silm:hasOrdinal 2 .
silm:phase_g_3 a owl:NamedIndividual, silm:Phase ; rdfs:label "Author DAG SHACL shapes (acyclicity, consumes/produces, provenBy)" ; silm:hasOrdinal 3 .
silm:phase_g_4 a owl:NamedIndividual, silm:Phase ; rdfs:label "Author DAG SPARQL/GeoSPARQL (topo-order over S/O/P towers)" ; silm:hasOrdinal 4 .

silm:phase_w1_1 a owl:NamedIndividual, silm:Phase ; rdfs:label "Seed agent protocol (Praeriehund+unary) into every brief" ; silm:hasOrdinal 1 .
silm:phase_w1_2 a owl:NamedIndividual, silm:Phase ; rdfs:label "Full-clone forge/{base_agents,base_templates,base,example_gippidy_01}" ; silm:hasOrdinal 2 .
silm:phase_w1_3 a owl:NamedIndividual, silm:Phase ; rdfs:label "Map base_agents golden + r1_staging/*/** generics" ; silm:hasOrdinal 3 .
silm:phase_w1_4 a owl:NamedIndividual, silm:Phase ; rdfs:label "Map base_templates AOB atom-yml macro grammar" ; silm:hasOrdinal 4 .
silm:phase_w1_5 a owl:NamedIndividual, silm:Phase ; rdfs:label "Map base category theory (sheaf/semiring/lens; turtles/polysemy)" ; silm:hasOrdinal 5 .
silm:phase_w1_6 a owl:NamedIndividual, silm:Phase ; rdfs:label "Map example_gippidy_01 v17 (projections + Jena 6.2.0 native runners)" ; silm:hasOrdinal 6 .
silm:phase_w1_7 a owl:NamedIndividual, silm:Phase ; rdfs:label "Map sparky/lambda-blotto + reference/pylib red receipts" ; silm:hasOrdinal 7 .
silm:phase_w1_8 a owl:NamedIndividual, silm:Phase ; rdfs:label "Taxonomy census (every taxonomy: root/axes/projections/provisional gaps)" ; silm:hasOrdinal 8 .
silm:phase_w1_9 a owl:NamedIndividual, silm:Phase ; rdfs:label "Complete Component Account seed (per-entry disposition + inverse)" ; silm:hasOrdinal 9 .
silm:phase_w1_10 a owl:NamedIndividual, silm:Phase ; rdfs:label "Write findings to distinct ledger files" ; silm:hasOrdinal 10 .

# W2 decomposed into 9 sub-projects (brainstorming, 2026-08-07); every original W2
# concern preserved and regrouped. Each sub-project runs its own spec->plan->build cycle.
# SP1 subsumes the old full-lexical-identity scheme (via its Identifier URN tower).
#
# SP1 COMPLETED 2026-08-08 (remediation wf, panel NO-GO -> GREEN; then categorical enrichment
# STEPS A-D: rho made a genuine FUNCTOR ON ARROWS, closed as LITERAL YONEDA; then STEP E gave the two
# decorative residuals real teeth — Frame=Yoneda-point + Yoneda-evaluation soundness, and composite-
# transport existence/coverage — ENRICH, never strip).
# Green evidence, captured verbatim from a fresh run of
# basicttl/primitives/checks/run-floor-checks.sh + the STEP-D/E probe battery:
#   parse OK: 4 data ttl, 8346 triples (was 3123 pre-enrichment; STEP E added ASKs+shapes, NOT data
#     triples, so the data graph stays 8346); pyshacl conforms=True (0 results) over 13 sh:NodeShapes.
#   21/21 EXPECT-TRUE ASKs PASS (0 failed): the original 12 — q_number_tower, q_number_realized,
#     q_universality, q_colimit_roundtrip, q_colimit_reflexive, q_frame_effect, q_bytevector_cap,
#     q_kleisli_welltyped, q_monad_unit, q_monad_assoc, q_byte_descent, q_rgb — PLUS the 6 STEP-D
#     functor/Yoneda probes: q_functor_identity, q_functor_composition,
#     q_ancestral_transport_resolves, q_yoneda_faithful, q_yoneda_full, q_naturality_commutes — PLUS
#     the 3 STEP-E residual-teeth ASKs: q_yoneda_point, q_yoneda_evaluation_sound,
#     q_functor_composition_total. Depth gate PASSED (5 files, every owl:Class >=200-char).
#   Universal dual-grounding: 59 tower classes, UNGROUNDED count = 0 (spec §9a); 59/59 direct
#     (realizesFrom + own reflexive carrier + own Primitive) — PRESERVED across the enrichment.
#   Categorical enrichment materialised (spec §9h): 59 prim:SubtypeArrow + 60 prim:IdentityArrow +
#     45 prim:CompositeArrow (thin category, formal.ttl); 164 prim:RealizationTransport (60 id + 59
#     subtype + 45 composite) with matching transportDom/Cod = rho(dom)/rho(cod), every SubtypeArrow
#     well-typed-transported (0 missing); 45 prim:AncestralGroundingPath over 45 realized-proper-
#     ancestor pairs (0 uncovered) = "dual-grounded two ways" (realization.ttl); 60
#     prim:RepresentablePresheaf (injective yonedaObject: 60 objs -> 60 distinct reprs = faithful),
#     59 prim:YonedaArrow (bijection with 59 SubtypeArrows = full), 60 prim:RhoComponent, 59
#     prim:NaturalitySquare (all natCommutes true), 60 prim:YonedaEvaluation (evalYields = rho(A), now
#     ENFORCED by q_yoneda_evaluation_sound + prim:YonedaEvaluationShape); Frame = Yoneda point
#     (prim:Frame prim:isYonedaPoint true, now ENFORCED by q_yoneda_point + prim:FrameYonedaPointShape);
#     every prim:CompositeArrow transported + every composable subtype pair covered (ENFORCED by
#     q_functor_composition_total + prim:CompositeTransportCoverageShape) (taiji.ttl).
#   Teeth proven by probe injection (each CAUGHT, SHACL conforms or ASK flips True->False):
#     (1) class-form orphan `ex:OrphanB a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf prim:FormalType`
#         -> prim:DualGroundingShape fires; q_universality True->False.
#     (2) over-wide ByteVector `prim:byteCount 129` -> prim:ByteVectorEncodingShape fires;
#         q_bytevector_cap True->False.
#     (3) wrong-type interpretAs (escapes FormalType tower) -> EncodingShape sh:sparql fires;
#         q_colimit_roundtrip True->False. (Also: wrong-facet Primitive -> ColimitReflexivityShape
#         fires; q_colimit_reflexive True->False.)
#     (4) ill-typed Kleisli composition (composeFirst=k_Real_Float64 kCod=Float64,
#         composeSecond=k_id_Real kDom=Real) -> prim:KleisliCompositionShape fires;
#         q_kleisli_welltyped True->False.
#     (5) broken subtype transportCod (rt_sub_Bignum_Integer transportCod->Bit) ->
#         prim:FunctorTransportShape fires; q_functor_composition True->False (broken leg).
#     (6) removed ancestral path (agp_Bignum_Integer) -> q_ancestral_transport_resolves True->False.
#     (7) collided representables (Bool yonedaObject->repr_Bag) -> q_yoneda_faithful True->False;
#         removed yonedaObject -> prim:YonedaShape fires.
#     (8) broken naturality corner (natComponentCod->wrong/dangling) -> q_naturality_commutes
#         True->False (both wrong-but-valid and dangling-malformed cases caught).
#     (9) violated functor identity (rt_id_Bignum transportCod->Bit) -> q_functor_identity
#         True->False; broken composite reify -> q_functor_composition True->False; removed
#         SubtypeArrow YonedaArrow -> q_yoneda_full True->False.
#     (10) STEP-E residual teeth: prim:Frame isYonedaPoint false -> prim:FrameYonedaPointShape fires;
#         q_yoneda_point True->False. Wrong evalYields (yeval_Bag evalYields Boolean) ->
#         prim:YonedaEvaluationShape fires; q_yoneda_evaluation_sound True->False. Deleted composite
#         transport (rt_comp_Bignum_Rational) -> prim:CompositeTransportCoverageShape fires;
#         q_functor_composition_total True->False. Deleted composite arrow for a still-composable pair
#         -> q_functor_composition_total True->False (coverage, ASK-enforced). Battery: 20/20 CAUGHT
